te":"0","role":0,"stats":[50,57,60,47,66,52],"title":-1,"rank":"6","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1014705","helmet":"WP1024605","horse":"WP1001315"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1067","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[50,57,60,47,66,52],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1014705","helmet":"WP1024605","horse":"WP1001315"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ1010002","city":"CS1067","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[50,57,60,47,66,52],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1014705","helmet":"WP1024605","horse":"WP1001315"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"高句丽第十三代君主西川王（高药卢）之子。官居古邹加。是第十四代君主烽上王（高相夫）的亲弟弟，也是第十五代君主美川王（高乙弗）的父亲.元康二年，其兄烽上王继位后诛杀了功高震主的叔父安国君达贾。次年九月，又以有叛乱之意为由，将高咄固赐死。","tc":"高句麗第十三代君主西川王（高藥盧）之子。官居古鄒加。是第十四代君主烽上王（高相夫）的親弟弟，也是第十五代君主美川王（高乙弗）的父親.元康二年，其兄烽上王繼位后誅殺了功高震主的叔父安國君達賈。次年九月，又以有叛亂之意為由，將高咄固賜死。","en":"Son of King Seocheon (Gao Yaolu), the 13th ruler of Goguryeo. He held the post of Gochuga. He was the younger brother of the 14th ruler, King Bongsang (Gao Xiangfu), and the father of the 15th ruler, King Micheon (Gao Yifu). In the second year of Yuankang, after his elder brother King Bongsang ascended the throne, he executed their uncle, Lord Anguo Dajia, whose overwhelming merit threatened the throne. In the ninth month of the following year, King Bongsang forced Gao Dugu to commit suicide on the grounds of harboring treasonous intent.","jp":"高句麗第十三代君主・西川王（高薬盧）の子。官位は古鄒加。第十四代君主・烽上王（高相夫）の実弟であり、第十五代君主・美川王（高乙弗）の父でもある。元康二年、兄の烽上王は即位後、功績が主を脅かすほどであった叔父の安国君・達賈を誅殺した。翌年九月、さらに謀反の意があるとして、高咄固を賜死とした。","kr":"고구려 제13대 군주 서천왕(고약로)의 아들이다. 관직은 고추가에 이르렀다. 제14대 군주 봉상왕(고상부)의 친동생이자 제15대 군주 미천왕(고을불)의 아버지이다. 원강 2년, 형인 봉상왕이 즉위한 후 공이 높아 군주를 위협하던 숙부 안국군 달가를 주살했다. 이듬해 9월에는 반역을 꾀한다는 구실로 고돌고를 사사했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1054315","remark":"普武","surname":"高","surnameTc":"高","surnameEn":"Gao","surnameJp":"高","surnameKr":"고","surnameOther":"","name":"咄固","nameTc":"咄固","nameEn":"Duogu","nameJp":"咄固","nameKr":"돌고","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"高咄固","power":"WJ1010002","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"223","city":"CS1067","gender":"0","rule":"50","force":"57","wise":"60","politics":"47","charm":"66","will":"52","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"6","charmTalent":"8","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"24/57/27/25/23/24/32/32","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"S1003505","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5000","battleSoulPoint":"6000","debateSoulPoint":"5100","strategy":"1000501","strategy2":"1005601","professions":"2/0/0/2/0/0/2/2/3/2/3/2/2/3/2/3/3/2/1/0/1/3/2/2","attribute2":"79/85/68/34/78/72","morality":"4","compatible":"55","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","evaluate":"2000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"264","show":"276","death":"293","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"5","weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1014705","helmet":"WP1024605","treasure":"","horse":"WP1001315","shield":"","character":"0/1;1/1;6/1;19/1;29/1;41/1;44/1;48/1;58/1;10/0;21/0;42/0","father":"WJ1054115/0","mother":"","children":"WJ1053915/100","family":"WJ1054215/100","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"","belief":"0","isVIP":"0","startVIPYear":"0",